  "description": "ITATAZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H78 Dy4 N6 O24,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.722-3.729 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.91-109.60°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(pdmH)2(pdm)4(PhCO2)2(PhCO2H)4]·CH3OH·H2O (C85H84N6O26Dy4).",
